    "model": "<p><b>(a)</b></p><div class=\"tablewrap\"><table><tr><th>Input</th><th>Processing</th><th>Output</th></tr><tr><td>Age of each passenger (until -1 is entered)</td><td>For each age: if under 12 add 3.50 to total, otherwise add 6.00; add 1 to count. After the last passenger, compare total with 60.</td><td>Number of passengers; total fare; \"Full boat bonus\" if total &gt; 60</td></tr></table></div><p><b>(b)</b> Constant: CHILD_FARE = 3.50 (real/float). Variable: count, an integer that increases by 1 for each passenger (also: age integer, total real).</p><p><b>(c)</b></p><pre>START\n   ADULT_FARE ← 6.00\n   CHILD_FARE ← 3.50\n   count ← 0\n   total ← 0\n   PRINT \"Enter age (-1 to finish)\"\n   READ age\n   WHILE age &lt;&gt; -1 DO\n      IF age &lt; 12 THEN\n         total ← total + CHILD_FARE\n      ELSE\n         total ← total + ADULT_FARE\n      ENDIF\n      count ← count + 1\n      READ age\n   ENDWHILE\n   PRINT \"Passengers: \", count\n   PRINT \"Total fare: $\", total\n   IF total &gt; 60 THEN\n      PRINT \"Full boat bonus\"\n   ENDIF\nSTOP</pre><p><b>(d)</b></p><div class=\"tablewrap\"><table><tr><th>age</th><th>age &lt; 12?</th><th>count</th><th>total</th><th>Output</th></tr><tr><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>0</td><td>0.00</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>34</td><td>No</td><td>1</td><td>6.00</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Yes</td><td>2</td><td>9.50</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Yes</td><td>3</td><td>13.00</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>-1</td><td>–</td><td>3</td><td>13.00</td><td>Passengers: 3<br>Total fare: $13.00<br>(no bonus: 13.00 is not &gt; 60)</td></tr></table></div><p><b>(e)</b></p><pre># Lagoon Hop water-taxi fares\nADULT_FARE = 6.00\nCHILD_FARE = 3.50\ncount = 0\ntotal = 0.0\nage = int(input(\"Enter age (-1 to finish): \"))\nwhile age != -1:\n    if age &lt; 12:\n        total = total + CHILD_FARE\n    else:\n        total = total + ADULT_FARE\n    count = count + 1\n    age = int(input(\"Enter age (-1 to finish): \"))\nprint(\"Passengers:\", count)\nprint(\"Total fare: $\", format(total, \".2f\"))\nif total &gt; 60:\n    print(\"Full boat bonus\")</pre><p><b>(f)</b> <b>Normal:</b> 30, a typical adult age that should add $6.00. <b>Boundary:</b> 11 and 12, either side of the point where the fare changes (11 → $3.50, 12 → $6.00). <b>Erroneous:</b> -5 or \"ten\", which are not valid ages and should be rejected (\"ten\" would crash int()).</p>",
