    "prompt": "<p>Ms. Cato-Carty wants to invite the candidates for <b>Layou</b> to the Results Night.</p><ol type=\"a\"><li>Create a primary (main) document for a letter on NYEC letterhead (organisation name, address <i>12 Bay Street, Kingstown</i>, e-mail <i>info@nyec.vc</i>). The letter must include today's date and the merge fields <b>FirstName</b>, <b>LastName</b>, <b>School</b> and <b>Constituency</b>. The body should invite the candidate to Results Night on <b>Thursday 28 May 2026 at 7:00 p.m.</b> at the St. Vincent and the Grenadines Youth Centre. Use <b>Candidates.csv</b> as the data source. Save as <code>ResultsLetter</code>. <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>Filter the recipients so that letters are produced ONLY for candidates in Layou. Merge to a new document and save it as <code>LayouLetters</code>. <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>Create a fillable electronic form <code>PollingAgentForm</code> headed <b>NYEC Polling Agent Application</b> with: a text field for Full name; a drop-down list for School (Hummingbird Ridge High School, Flamboyant Heights College, Calabash Point Secondary, Other); a drop-down list for Constituency (the four constituencies); a date picker for Date of birth; a check box labelled <i>I agree to follow the NYEC code of conduct</i>. Protect the form so that only the fields can be filled in. <i>(4 marks)</i></li></ol><p>In the answer box, list the steps you took and paste the text of your letter, showing the merge fields in «chevrons», then the names on the merged letters and the controls on your form.</p><p class=\"row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost\" data-gx=\"opengame\" data-page=\"games/wordsim.html?level=3\" data-id=\"wordsim\">📘 Open the Word Lab</button> <span class=\"hint\">Mail merge and form controls are in Level 3 of the Word Lab.</span></p>",
