    "teacherTip": "<p>Candidates often type the names into the letter instead of inserting merge fields: no marks. Others merge all 12 candidates; the filter is a separate mark. For the form, CXC wants the right control for each prompt; a plain text box for School loses the drop-down mark.</p>",
