     "teacherTip": "<p>In (a), the names must be merge fields inserted from Candidates.csv («FirstName» «LastName»); typed names earn nothing. In (b), only three letters should be produced (Kemar Hazel, Tia Ollivierre and Jaylen DaSilva); merging all 12 loses the mark. In (c), the drop-down needs all four constituencies as its choices, and the check box must be a check-box content control, not a typed square.</p>",
