     "model": "<p><b>(a)</b> Dear «FirstName» «LastName», the National Youth Electoral Commission invites you to Results Night on Thursday 28 May 2026 at 7:00 p.m. at the St. Vincent and the Grenadines Youth Centre.</p><p><b>(b)</b> Filter Constituency equal to Layou: letters for Kemar Hazel, Tia Ollivierre and Jaylen DaSilva.</p><p><b>(c)</b> Drop-down list: Kingstown, Georgetown, Layou, Barrouallie. Check box: I agree to follow the NYEC code of conduct.</p>",
