    "genre": "Paper 032 Question 2 · Web page design · SOs 4.9, 4.10, 4.11 (7 marks)",
    "prompt": "<p>Create the home page <code>index.html</code> of the NYEC website <b>Vote Youth SVG</b>. It must contain:</p><ol type=\"a\"><li>A logo image at the top (any image named <code>nyec-logo.png</code>) with suitable alternative text, and the heading <b>Vote Youth SVG 2026</b>. <i>(1 mark)</i></li><li>A navigation bar with links to two other pages, <code>candidates.html</code> and <code>howtovote.html</code>. <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>A hyperlink that opens an e-mail to <code>info@nyec.vc</code>. <i>(1 mark)</i></li><li>A hyperlink to the file <code>PollingAgentForm.docx</code> you created in Question 1. <i>(1 mark)</i></li><li>A section headed <b>Key dates</b> lower on the page, and a link at the top that jumps to it. <i>(1 mark)</i></li><li>A consistent design: page title, readable font, colour scheme and a footer. <i>(1 mark)</i></li></ol><p>Paste your HTML (or describe each element if you used a website builder) in the answer box.</p><p class=\"row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost\" data-gx=\"opengame\" data-page=\"games/websim.html?level=3\" data-id=\"websim\">🌐 Open the Web Page Builder</button> <span class=\"hint\">Build it in the Web Page Builder and switch to Code view to copy your HTML.</span></p>",
    "min": 60,
    "max": 600,
    "frame": "<p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt; &lt;html&gt; &lt;head&gt;&lt;title&gt;…&lt;/title&gt;&lt;/head&gt; &lt;body&gt; &lt;img src=\"nyec-logo.png\" alt=\"…\"&gt; &lt;h1&gt;…&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;nav&gt; &lt;a href=\"…\"&gt; … &lt;/nav&gt; &lt;a href=\"#keydates\"&gt; … &lt;a href=\"mailto:…\"&gt; … &lt;a href=\"PollingAgentForm.docx\"&gt; … &lt;h2 id=\"keydates\"&gt; … &lt;footer&gt; …</p>",
