     "teacherTip": "<p>The four hyperlink types (another page, same-page bookmark, e-mail, user-created file) are tested every year: href=\"#keydates\" needs a matching id, and the file link must be relative (PollingAgentForm.docx), not a path such as C:\\Users\\…. In (g), the table needs &lt;th&gt; header cells, three candidate rows and a &lt;caption&gt;. In (h), each criterion must be applied to this page (for example, does the navigation fit on a phone?) and the change must follow from the evaluation.</p>",
