     "model": "<pre>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n  &lt;meta charset=\"utf-8\"&gt;\n  &lt;title&gt;Vote Youth SVG 2026 | Home&lt;/title&gt;\n  &lt;style&gt;\n    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; color: #1d2a44; }\n    header, footer { background: #0b5d6b; color: #fff; padding: 12px 20px; }\n    nav a { color: #fff; margin-right: 16px; font-weight: bold; }\n    main { padding: 16px 20px; }\n  &lt;/style&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n  &lt;header&gt;\n    &lt;img src=\"nyec-logo.png\" alt=\"National Youth Electoral Commission logo\" width=\"90\"&gt;\n    &lt;h1&gt;Vote Youth SVG 2026&lt;/h1&gt;\n    &lt;nav&gt;\n      &lt;a href=\"index.html\"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;\n      &lt;a href=\"candidates.html\"&gt;Candidates&lt;/a&gt;\n      &lt;a href=\"howtovote.html\"&gt;How to vote&lt;/a&gt;\n      &lt;a href=\"#keydates\"&gt;Key dates&lt;/a&gt;\n    &lt;/nav&gt;\n  &lt;/header&gt;\n  &lt;main&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;Every student aged 14 to 19 can vote for the Youth Parliament. Find your polling station and meet the candidates.&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;Want to help on polling day? &lt;a href=\"PollingAgentForm.docx\"&gt;Download the Polling Agent application form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;Questions? &lt;a href=\"mailto:info@nyec.vc\"&gt;E-mail the Commission&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;h2 id=\"keydates\"&gt;Key dates&lt;/h2&gt;\n    &lt;ul&gt;\n      &lt;li&gt;Polling day: Tuesday 26 May 2026, 8:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m.&lt;/li&gt;\n      &lt;li&gt;Results Night: Thursday 28 May 2026, 7:00 p.m.&lt;/li&gt;\n    &lt;/ul&gt;\n  &lt;/main&gt;\n  &lt;footer&gt;© 2026 National Youth Electoral Commission · 12 Bay Street, Kingstown&lt;/footer&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;</pre><p>Design decisions: the logo and navigation sit in the same header on every page (consistency); teal and white give strong contrast; the alt text describes the logo for screen readers.</p><p><b>(g)</b></p><pre>&lt;table&gt;\n  &lt;caption&gt;Layou candidates 2026&lt;/caption&gt;\n  &lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Name&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Party&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;School&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\n  &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Kemar Hazel&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Next Gen Alliance&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Hummingbird Ridge High School&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\n  &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Tia Ollivierre&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Green Hills Youth&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Flamboyant Heights College&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\n  &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Jaylen DaSilva&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Forward Together&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Calabash Point Secondary&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</pre><p><b>(h)</b> <b>Accessibility:</b> the logo has alt text and the colours contrast strongly, so the page works with screen readers. <b>Display on phones:</b> without a viewport meta tag the page shows zoomed out on a phone. Change: add <code>&lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"&gt;</code> and let the nav links wrap, so most voters, who visit on phones, can read it easily.</p>",
