     "teacherTip": "<p>Sorting and filtering are both done in Edit Recipient List: District equal to Basseterre, sorted by SchoolName, gives three letters. A header and a heading are different things: the header is the top-margin area of every page. In (d), the envelopes or labels must include all eight coaches, so clear the Basseterre filter first; the footnote and endnote must be inserted from the References tab; and only ONE page turns landscape when section breaks (Next Page) are placed before and after the wide table, because orientation applies to a whole section.</p>",
     "frame": "<p><b>(a)</b> Letterhead … Dear «Coach», … «SchoolName» … Your confirmation will be sent to «CoachEmail».<br><b>(b)</b> Filter District equal to Basseterre; Sort by SchoolName … Letters for …<br><b>(c)</b> Styles … page breaks … Insert ▸ Header … Page number … References ▸ Table of Contents … table inserted …<br><b>(d)</b> Mailings ▸ Start Mail Merge ▸ Envelopes (or Labels) ▸ Schools.csv … all eight … Footnote: References ▸ Insert Footnote … Endnote: References ▸ Insert Endnote … Landscape: Section Break (Next Page) before and after the table ▸ Layout ▸ Orientation ▸ Landscape, so only that page …</p>",
     "bloom": "Create",
     "prompt": "<ol type=\"a\"><li>Create a primary document <code>CoachLetter</code> on ISSF letterhead inviting each coach to the technical meeting on <b>Monday 9 March 2026 at 4:00 p.m.</b> in the Sea-Almond auditorium. Use <b>Schools.csv</b> as the data source and insert the merge fields <b>Coach</b>, <b>SchoolName</b> and <b>CoachEmail</b> (in a line that reads <i>Your confirmation will be sent to «CoachEmail»</i>). <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>Merge only the letters for schools in the <b>Basseterre</b> district, sorted by SchoolName. Save as <code>BasseterreCoaches</code>. <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>Create <code>ChampionshipProgramme</code> using the programme headings in the case study with Heading 1 and Heading 2 styles, a short paragraph under each, each Heading 1 on a new page, a header containing <i>ISSF Championship 2026</i>, page numbers in the footer and an automatic table of contents on page 1. Under Participating Schools insert a table (copied from Schools.csv) of SchoolName and Coach. <i>(4 marks)</i></li><li>Produce envelopes (or labels) for ALL eight coaches, and in the programme add a footnote to Championship Records, a landscape page for a wide Order of Events table, and an endnote crediting the photographer. Explain how you made only ONE page landscape. <i>(4 marks)</i></li></ol><p>Describe your steps, show the letter with «merge fields», list the merged letters, and give the final table of contents.</p><p class=\"row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost\" data-gx=\"opengame\" data-page=\"games/wordsim.html?level=3\" data-id=\"wordsim\">📘 Open the Word Lab</button></p>",
