     "model": "<p><b>(a)</b> Schools: PK <b>SchoolCode</b>. Athletes: PK <b>AthleteID</b>; Distance Number (Integer); BestTime Number, Field Size <b>Double</b>, Decimal Places 2; Gender Validation Rule <code>\"M\" Or \"F\"</code>, Validation Text <i>Enter M or F</i>. Relationship Schools.SchoolCode (one) → Athletes.SchoolCode (many), Enforce Referential Integrity.</p><p><b>(b) BasseterreGirls100</b></p><div class=\"tablewrap\"><table class=\"qbe\"><tr><th>Field</th><td>SchoolName</td><td>FirstName</td><td>LastName</td><td>BestTime</td><td>Gender</td><td>Event</td><td>District</td></tr><tr><th>Table</th><td>Schools</td><td>Athletes</td><td>Athletes</td><td>Athletes</td><td>Athletes</td><td>Athletes</td><td>Schools</td></tr><tr><th>Sort</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>Ascending</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>Show</th><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>☐</td><td>☐</td><td>☐</td></tr><tr><th>Criteria</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>\"F\"</td><td>\"100m\"</td><td>\"Basseterre\"</td></tr></table></div><p>Results: Sea-Almond Secondary School, Kayla Liburd, 12.71; Breadfruit Valley Secondary, Shanice Duzant, 13.05; Mahoe Grove High School, Aaliyah York, 13.28. (Tia Carty, 13.62, is excluded because Hummingbird Ridge High School is in Cotton Ground.)</p><p><b>(c) Speeds</b></p><div class=\"tablewrap\"><table class=\"qbe\"><tr><th>Field</th><td>FirstName</td><td>LastName</td><td>Event</td><td>Speed: Round([Distance]/[BestTime],2)</td></tr><tr><th>Table</th><td>Athletes</td><td>Athletes</td><td>Athletes</td><td></td></tr><tr><th>Sort</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>Descending</td></tr><tr><th>Show</th><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td></tr><tr><th>Criteria</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></table></div><p>Fastest three: Tariq Nisbett (100m) 8.80 m/s; Malik Hodge (200m) 8.63 m/s; Zion Peterson (100m) 8.41 m/s; slowest: Rhea Hanley 6.54 m/s.</p><p><b>(d)</b> Form Wizard ▸ Schools: SchoolCode, SchoolName, District, Coach ▸ Athletes: AthleteID, FirstName, LastName, Gender, Event, BestTime ▸ view by Schools ▸ Form with subform(s) ▸ name <b>SchoolAthletes</b>.</p><p><b>(e)</b> Report Wizard ▸ SchoolName (Schools), FirstName, LastName, Event, BestTime (Athletes) ▸ view by Schools (grouping <b>SchoolName</b>) ▸ sort <b>Event</b> then LastName ▸ in Design View add a text box <code>=Count(*)</code> labelled <i>Athletes entered</i> in the SchoolName footer ▸ title on two lines:</p><div class=\"passage\"><b>Inter-Schools Sports Federation</b><br><b>2026 Athletics Championship Entries by School</b></div><p>Counts: Sea-Almond Secondary School 3; Hummingbird Ridge High School 2; Breadfruit Valley Secondary 3; Flamboyant Heights College 1; Sandbox Tree College 1; Mahoe Grove High School 2; Frangipani Hill Academy 1; Seagrape Bay Secondary School 1; total 14.</p><p><b>(f) AthletesByEvent</b></p><div class=\"tablewrap\"><table class=\"qbe\"><tr><th>Field</th><td>SchoolName</td><td>FirstName</td><td>LastName</td><td>Event</td><td>BestTime</td></tr><tr><th>Table</th><td>Schools</td><td>Athletes</td><td>Athletes</td><td>Athletes</td><td>Athletes</td></tr><tr><th>Sort</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>Ascending</td></tr><tr><th>Show</th><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td></tr><tr><th>Criteria</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>[Enter event:]</td><td></td></tr></table></div><p>Entering 200m returns Malik Hodge 23.18, Dante Brantley 24.02, Precious Hazel 26.35, Imani Lake 27.90.</p><p><b>(g)</b> Storing coach details once in Schools avoids <b>data redundancy</b>: the coach of Sea-Almond appears once instead of in every Sea-Almond athlete's record, saving space and avoiding <b>update anomalies</b> (if the coach changes, one record is edited, so the data stays consistent). <b>Referential integrity</b> means every Athletes.SchoolCode must match an existing Schools.SchoolCode: you cannot enter an athlete for a school code that does not exist (e.g. XYZ), and you cannot delete a school that still has athletes, so no \"orphan\" athlete records are left without a school.</p>",
